<title>USA: Oceaneering unit to sell N.Sea diving assets.</title>
<headline>Oceaneering unit to sell N.Sea diving assets.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oceaneering International Inc said its UK subsidiary Oceaneering International Services Ltd entered into an agreement with DSND Oceantech Ltd to sell its North Sea diving assets and operations.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Oceaneering said it expected to record the deal during the fourth quarter ending March 31 without substantial effect on its results.</p>
</text>
